Create a mutable Studio package lifecycle draft (query, analysis, map, dashboard, report, form, app, workflow, gp, or etl family). The composition a user and agent build IS this draft (AD-8): the returned draft's generation must be passed as `generation` on every subsequent honua_studio_update_draft / composition-mutation call for optimistic concurrency. The optional `ownerId` field is admin-only; non-admin callers must omit it and become the owner automatically.

Tool annotations (JSON): {"title":"Create Studio draft","readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false}

