Save the current Studio draft generation as an immutable version through the governed Studio runtime. Use the returned version.itemId, version.versionId and version.contentHash for publication or reopen. Read the draft again before editing it further because saving refreshes its generation. An approval-required operation has no saved version yet; follow its proposal before continuing.

Tool annotations (JSON): {"title":"Save Studio version","readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false}

Expected structured output schema (JSON): {"type":"object","properties":{"operation":{"type":"object","required":["operationId","operationInstanceId","status"],"properties":{"operationId":{"type":"string"},"operationInstanceId":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string"},"proposalId":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"version":{"type":["object","null"],"properties":{"itemId":{"type":"string"},"versionId":{"type":"string"},"contentHash":{"type":"string"},"envelope":{"type":"object"},"validation":{"type":"object"}}},"studioAuthorizationCode":{},"status":{"type":"string","const":"error"},"code":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"},"currentGeneration":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1},"error":{"type":"object"}},"oneOf":[{"not":{"required":["status","code","message","error"]},"required":["operation"],"properties":{"studioAuthorizationCode":{"type":["string","null"]}}},{"required":["status","code","message","error"],"properties":{"studioAuthorizationCode":{"type":["string","null"]}}}]}

Replace a Studio package lifecycle draft's editable fields (packageKey, workspaceId, ownerId, schemaVersion, format, body) with optimistic-generation checking. Pass the `generation` last read from honua_studio_get_draft/honua_studio_create_draft; a stale generation returns a failed_precondition error — re-fetch and retry rather than blindly resubmitting. The optional `ownerId` field is admin-only; non-admin callers must omit it. Does not accept publicationIntent: use honua_studio_propose_publication to record publish intent.

Tool annotations (JSON): {"title":"Update Studio draft","readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false}

Expected structured output schema (JSON): {"type":"object","properties":{"draftId":{"type":"string"},"itemId":{"type":"string"},"packageKey":{"type":"string"},"workspaceId":{"type":["string","null"]},"ownerId":{"type":["string","null"]},"family":{"type":"string"},"envelope":{"type":"object"},"validation":{"type":"object"},"baseVersionId":{"type":["string","null"]},"generation":{"type":"integer","description":"Optimistic-concurrency generation. Pass this value as `generation` on the next mutating call for this draft."},"createdBy":{"type":["string","null"]},"updatedBy":{"type":["string","null"]},"createdAt":{"type":"string"},"updatedAt":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","const":"error"},"code":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"},"studioAuthorizationCode":{"type":["string","null"]},"currentGeneration":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1},"error":{"type":"object"}},"oneOf":[{"not":{"required":["status","code","message","error"]},"required":["draftId","itemId","packageKey","family","envelope","generation","createdAt","updatedAt"]},{"required":["status","code","message","error"]}]}

Validate a Studio package lifecycle draft's current envelope and return the validation summary. Genuinely read-only: it does NOT persist the result onto the draft or change its generation (unlike the REST admin POST .../validate endpoint), so it is always safe to call between composition-mutation calls.

Tool annotations (JSON): {"title":"Validate Studio draft","readOnlyHint":true,"destructiveHint":false}

Expected structured output schema (JSON): {"type":"object","properties":{"status":{},"diagnostics":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"object"}},"unsupportedCapabilities":{"type":"array","items":{"type":"string"}},"generatedAt":{"type":["string","null"]},"code":{"type":"string"},"message":{"type":"string"},"studioAuthorizationCode":{"type":["string","null"]},"currentGeneration":{"type":["integer","null"],"minimum":1},"error":{"type":"object"}},"oneOf":[{"not":{"required":["status","code","message","error"]},"required":["status"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","enum":["not-validated","valid","warning","invalid"]}}},{"required":["status","code","message","error"],"properties":{"status":{"type":"string","const":"error"}}}]}

Submit an exact saved Studio item/version/contentHash plus route and visibility for human approval. Returns canonical operation and proposal identities; no publication pointer moves before separate-principal approval.

Tool annotations (JSON): {"title":"Propose Studio publication","readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true}

